@@ -12,6 +12,9 @@ Its state is lost when the process stops; persistence comes later.
 - `addEquipment({ id, kind, dailyPrice })` adds an item. `kind` is `'board'` or `'sail'`.
 - `quote({ itemId, start, end })` returns `{ itemId, start, end, total }` without reserving anything.
 - `book({ itemId, start, end })` reserves the item and returns `{ id, itemId, start, end, total }`.
+- `availability({ start, end, kind })` returns the sorted ids of the equipment free for the whole period, so the
+  desk can see at a glance what can still be rented. `kind` is optional: when it is omitted, every kind is listed.
+  It reserves nothing.
 
 The school's rules, which apply to every operation:
 
